Subject: [PATCH] Neko LineageOS: Add Boot_completed broadcast receiver control

We can prevent a app from starting on boot by disabling its broadcast receiver, but for some apps (e.g. Alipay)
will automatically re-enable it after users launch it

TODO: A more forced way is needed
